# Ordinary history invocation Source hold

One input-only writer creates a fresh request and exact policy02 bytecopy. It
does not build or execute the observer, import project code, parse Native event
values, alter inputs or perform numerical comparison. Native05's released A24
freeze and all45 guards remain literal. Historical frozen documentation is not
rebound to current documents. Full Native transitive QA remains the comparer's
responsibility; this writer requires its actual successful release and joins.

Root supplies path#SHA operands for the approved writer manifest, Native freeze
and its execution, Original review and its execution, actual exporter application
inventory, four quality executions, and actual CargoJSON build execution. Actual
raw SourceSnapshot equality and chronology bind four checks to the build. The
executable comes only from Cargo's captured example artifact; cache hits are valid.

Root records the four unchanged checks with record_command.py, then this build:

```text
cargo build --config profile.dev.debug=0 --config profile.test.debug=0 --config build.incremental=false --locked -p ep_run --example ctf10_ordinary_history_observer --message-format=json-render-diagnostics
```

Record the writer itself before the ordinary run:

```text
python -X utf8 -B tools/porting/record_command.py --output-dir <fresh-writer-command-dir> -- python -X utf8 -B .runtime/porting/CTF-10/ordinary-history-invocation-prep-01/write_request.py --source-manifest <this-manifest#SHA> --native-freeze <path#SHA> --native-freeze-execution <path#SHA> --original-review <path#SHA> --original-review-execution <path#SHA> --applied-source <path#SHA> --fmt-check <path#SHA> --clippy <path#SHA> --focused <path#SHA> --workspace <path#SHA> --build-execution <path#SHA> --output-dir <fresh-request-dir>
```

Outputs are request.json, verbatim policy.json and an empty capture/ directory.
The requested ordinary output directory, NDJSON and recorder directory remain
absent. The request contains exact intended `command` (emitted executable plus
four arguments) and `recorded_command`; neither is a future receipt or outcome.
Actual writer and ordinary receipts remain external comparer operands.

Before any capture file exists, Root may execute the declared `compact /c` on
the empty capture directory. New files then inherit normal NTFS compression;
the full logical byte stream remains uncapped. Never compact an active file.
Source/input-only footprint fields are planning estimates, not branch, visit,
allocation or warmup predictions. Plan several GiB raw, plus build artifacts.
No required missing/unavailable boundary, footer or failing process can PASS.

Source authority is exporter0754 and policy02. An actual reviewed application
inventory is carried as an operand; it is not impersonated as the held literal
proposal or silently treated as formatter proof. Root's separate actual formatter
review and the comparer's inventory/custody validation remain mandatory.
